        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "年初，她止步布里斯班8强。澳网决赛，决胜盘零比三落后，她却以六比四逆转，赢下冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "dd62614971b9d28b78bd86bf2eaa1bfa64ff893f35136fb27c57af6d97a1a011",
      "words_sha256": "0eaeb173203aa42afcff1fbef7e79b7458dec12d1c78618ddf4cb3e250d22ee8",
      "words_path": "voice_03.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d0d8ae2db4e69a4d8e299f422a38ad85",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "多哈止步8强，迪拜因病退赛。来到印第安维尔斯，她又打进决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "71efce35e9907f3c1d822384e90212c124638d0e7ee9cfc4eb66ea47c9c01f5b",
      "words_sha256": "13043ffb1b2a4e2214397e14c99cce3b0ad9a6f7a8c4c56e6d9b04f65c0f9f2f",
      "words_path": "voice_04.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f5afb03ee9e626e05584889a8809cc55",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "莱巴金娜握有冠军点，却没能拿下。决胜盘抢七六比八，她输给萨巴伦卡。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "58cf74fdfa0d85307cc06a9a991d75c31ce8712d183b7d73dd35de20f12d7f87",
      "words_sha256": "2774db0513b706ab7592f42301a231ecf3be2e8a5de1908b22a9f640fe0dc5ca",
      "words_path": "voice_06.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d82e29097adc87101dbe6d4d4321e928",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "迈阿密半决赛，萨巴伦卡再次让她止步。四月的斯图加特，她先挽救两个赛点过关，最终在决赛击败穆霍娃。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c87abf710a836995d9acaa5bb6703e0b3182b945520ff5a9bf9d816fb0f98fb6",
      "words_sha256": "b8fe76d97af1ac336a19c08af7aae5f1aa6892ecd48f31a9389081522d59ea18",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c5735e998576fb655e8b6345642c6763",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "马德里第四轮出局，罗马止步8强。来到法网，她先赢一盘，却输掉决胜盘抢七，止步第二轮。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e1d272df13a36d0513463a23df4ef6187a8244092a7c7baf1e89bd175e942169",
      "words_sha256": "67047a232b90f8a401aff10fa94af0d9fba36baf5270b14fe811869ea0983895",
      "words_path": "voice_12.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "aeb5a76a9e74703a1bd6b9696e4a3870",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "草地赛季，女王杯打进8强，伯林第二轮出局。回到温网，她在第三轮输给梅尔滕斯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "980ffa0126ec8e348017b6530915245b0072f04b425d37e1782cfc7887eda7e5",
      "words_sha256": "0bdc2ca881251a69bb97bbc63ea7e70399baf500cb8c5be3d3af49789fa92154",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2e1372a7b50472a00348b1831895d588",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "八月，多伦多。莱巴金娜连续逆转大坂直美和高芙，再次走进决赛。最后，她输给斯瓦泰克。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a936d2726c9fcfcb18fc0a8d2c7e783c34064d384852769a662e5b4adc4e8db3",
      "words_sha256": "b774767cef061c72948f01d7a1602af2e50f56d57d84364a2bbd345b27b64c56",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "92d9e0a7dd73d048649512fc1303de98",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "辛辛那提四分之一决赛，两人又相遇。首盘一比四，莱巴金娜因伤退赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "09013be881e7ea09bcc4c0786fe6aafd5b8a337dcd7951680e81dbb2b53562dc",
      "words_sha256": "c5f2a1d5399b8c017e713a5009977281317646ed23ad858aabfbbd0ec1ef8b83",
      "words_path": "voice_17.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "17f806628ef16726812de36d27b4baa3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "到了纽约，对郑钦文、对高芙，她都是先丢一盘后逆转。决赛，又是萨巴伦卡。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "2f4de5179a4f66cc943f04153bdbc49ea2b664832d6b865dc2807584a60916f4",
      "words_sha256": "74670cea9e9c8b93cae3a4d234cdec9b6224eb0c04747e603b04dd7d352732d0",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a8d3d34ca6c7f303dd078e8e6318c19a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年第三次在决赛相遇，莱巴金娜用三盘胜利，拿下本赛季第二座大满贯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c0a7d01a12c9675b219b506102b21ce5bc7d8f234fa7f18935db184706292060",
      "words_sha256": "971b94c9ecc86b51532ed96cffdc6047300e32396477001d32940ee8f80724ba",
      "words_path": "voice_21.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0ed3670b59667a71ffdf615250b7cb04",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "九月十四日，WTA正式确认：莱巴金娜，是本届年终的首位单打入围者。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "743262a1c294bde2fb53efe1084450a2539c19ef17ccf5fd03895c8222791caa",
      "words_sha256": "999907b85c75b440d3616e6578bb86ca1be2efc11e4cd679d9f5b81eeea50815",
      "words_path": "voice_22.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6f6fa360cedc392a3f2af9a5437b7c93",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "也是这一天，她正式登上世界第一。但这个赛季，还没有结束。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "396d25fb4e5737982bfebf10305a4e3daec3137d7791308c82036b5442c085a0",
      "words_sha256": "b4b65f377b822a9edf2652470d80c3069e5e9576f113bf08cae79c7160f441de",
      "words_path": "voice_23.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "28975ea199f51b17f9bf410ba03f4a17",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "九月十八日，她因医疗原因，退出金杯总决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8af7c6be65ca3393bb0c179d2390bb05e1594dbc40674609bebc2b7c2f87841a",
      "words_sha256": "a29b1ca166bdbb28205f530281be67b730b21e9a25af76c1009700c9fae37d1e",
      "words_path": "voice_24.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cbb298cf88c655df423a27312f3817b9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十月三日，北京。她以世界第一身份出战的首场比赛，对手是恰拉耶娃。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a950e9ad8ddc95cba31157a10c8cfd649fae56cae792c578e6bd5f63e4008ea3",
      "words_sha256": "d7ad1c96d93a477d260929383216138529f946faa55ec8e784ab336a7c61c2b2",
      "words_path": "voice_26.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7c9cbb33fcfd01e4970bf09d8cc89e04",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "先赢一盘，再丢两盘。中网第二轮，成了她这一站的终点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "4d73b1e05902156767495e51a24a00dc977d5324355fd99190b6739f98cca9d6",
      "words_sha256": "0836b35b62f66945cb61ca5453edbd7a4dd6d08bae6565a12d2c15b69cccfe5e",
      "words_path": "voice_27.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "326fbd76831ff11b1a6653191c5259a6",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二天，她又因伤退出武汉。两座大满贯，也不能替她免去恢复的时间。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "260c7f6f4a4b866e5a4fd9142ca9ef54cd93e988f60dc38755d4c4f86a468380",
      "words_sha256": "4586cdf216824b640c7c9b866ee5140abfea612590a89b514ade6212adbee23d",
      "words_path": "voice_28.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9870dc93a4bab0eb0122dfcde9aeabb8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "去年，宁波夺冠后，她在东京赶上年终末班车。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "080891d6dd39707dceeef55c5dd8a1181cd2847358c962c03270db625f0a691a",
      "words_sha256": "96bda0ffd9b545f9e767b2164dea9a0d57301eac6ababf7ab3ce0cf35148add7",
      "words_path": "voice_29.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "96acbe7d34bb6109d944edcb47f14f8b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "随后五战全胜，在利雅得封后。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "0b05c643a7e77b655d38d83ddf089a7f701f40fe0793774436f1df9238205ead",
      "words_sha256": "8093bc1fef5e179407f42817f29eea094a958eb8781bdf7adeb2456b9f4e3423",
      "words_path": "voice_30.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "115602e88e5066d0698c60da808f0d94",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年，两夺大满贯、登顶世界第一，她又回到宁波卫冕。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8ff16c4070fdda690669f9a2720458fec6798e2d15355ddd8f0b6c89c010c980",
      "words_sha256": "080f24399901f7075ce25755a83b18947435c117ca842cbd4407ed81c96a2d3f",
      "words_path": "voice_33.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d262b47a225760af0bfe74e699dae85b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这一程腾飞，从宁波开始。年终，她还能再次捧杯吗？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_outro.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "4727a9e1ff78e2275f2ac5b5b193b3602ab096346ec05f562c26fc8635e5cfd2",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8",
      "words_path": "voice_outro.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    }
  ]
